# NexusAI vs Oracle Fusion: Module-by-Module Parity Assessment
## PART 3: Human Capital Management (HCM) Suite
*Page / Form / Field / Granular Level Comparison*

Legend: ✅ = Exists in NexusAI | ⚠️ = Partial / Simplified | ❌ = Missing entirely

> **Last Deep-Review:** March 9, 2026 — Phase 10 audit complete. Verified against live codebase. All components through Phase 10 reflected below. Phase 10 additions: `PayrollDefinitionSetup`, `EmploymentContractManager`, `PositionBudgetingWorkbench`, `HRJourneyTemplateBuilder`. PayrollWorkbench enhanced with all 5 missing Oracle PayRun fields.

