- ✅ [OrgChart.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/OrgChart.tsx)
- ✅ `hr/` sub-directory — **49 pages** (most comprehensive HR section)
- ✅ [HRReports.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/HRReports.tsx) (8.2KB) / [HRAnalyticsDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/HRAnalyticsDashboard.tsx) (10.3KB)
- ✅ [Attendance.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/Attendance.tsx) / [AttendanceDashboard.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/AttendanceDashboard.tsx)
- ✅ [OnboardingAutomation.tsx](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/src/pages/OnboardingAutomation.tsx)
- ✅ Schemas: [hr_worker.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/hr_worker.ts), [hr_structures.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/hr_structures.ts), [hr_compliance.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/hr_compliance.ts), [hr_delegation.ts](file:///Users/mbjunaid/My%20Projects/nexusai-erp-2/shared/schema/hr_delegation.ts)

### Oracle Pages/Forms NexusAI is Missing or Partial
| Oracle Form | NexusAI Status | Gap Description |
|---|---|---|
| **Hire Flow (New Person Wizard)** | ✅ Built | `src/pages/hr/HireFlowWizard.tsx` — 5-step guided wizard: Personal Info → Work Relationship → Assignment → Compensation → Review. |
| **DateTrack (Effective Dating on all forms)** | ⚠️ Partial | UI layer built: `src/pages/hr/EffectiveDatingPanel.tsx` — Create/Correct/Future-date modes + full assignment history table. Schema-level DateTrack rows require a DB migration. |
| **Assignment Form (Full Oracle)** | ⚠️ Partial | Basic assignment exists. Oracle's Assignment form has: Grade, Step, Grade Ladder, Probation End Date, Working Hours, Full-Time/Part-Time indicator, Manager (with DateTrack). |
| **Manager Self-Service (MSS) Guided Transactions** | ✅ Built | `src/pages/hr/GuidedJourneyWorkerTransfer.tsx` exists. |
| **Employment Contracts** | ✅ Built | `src/pages/hr/EmploymentContractManager.tsx` — Contract type (Fixed Term/Permanent/Zero-Hours/Agency), start/end date, renewal alert threshold, jurisdiction field, e-sign upload, status by worker (Active/Expiring/Expired). |
| **Position Management** | ✅ Built | `src/pages/hr/PositionBudgetingWorkbench.tsx` — Position FTE budget vs actual headcount, dept roll-up tree, vacancy approval/freeze workflow, utilisation progress bars. |
| **HR Help Desk (Journeys / HR Service Delivery)** | ✅ Built | `src/pages/hr/HRJourneyTemplateBuilder.tsx` — Journey templates with trigger events (Hire/Transfer/Termination/Life Event), ordered task checklist builder (day-offset due dates, assignee types), preview mode. |
| **Person Spotlight View** | ✅ Built | `src/pages/hr/PersonSpotlight.tsx` exists. |
| **Seniority / Length of Service Calculations** | ✅ Built | `src/pages/hr/SeniorityTracking.tsx` exists. Break-in-service rules, calculation modes, and service history table. |

### Key Field-Level Gaps (Worker / Assignment Form)
| Oracle Field | NexusAI Status |
|---|---|
| Person Number / Name (First/Middle/Last) | ✅ |
| Date of Birth | ✅ |
| National Identifier (SSN, NIN) | ⚠️ Exists but no format validation |
| Gender / Pronouns | ⚠️ Gender exists |
| Person Type (Employee / Contingent) | ✅ |
| Legal Employer | ✅ |
| Business Unit | ✅ |
| Department | ✅ |
| Job / Position | ✅ |
| Grade / Step / Grade Ladder | ✅ Built | `hrGradeSteps` table added to `hr_structures.ts`. See `GradeLadderSetup.tsx`. |
| Assignment Category (Full/Part Time) | ⚠️ |
| Probation End Date | ✅ Built | `probationEndDate` column added to `hrAssignments` in `hr_worker.ts`. |
| Effective Start/End Date (DateTrack) | ❌ **CRITICAL** — DB migration required |
| Manager (as of date) | ⚠️ Manager field exists, no DateTrack |
| Work Location | ✅ |
| Working Hours / Schedule | ✅ Built | `workingHoursPerWeek` column added to `hrAssignments`. |

